	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris came before the throne'
	R
	'with the same calm expression'
	R
	'as usual.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh...?'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance?'
	R
	'Where are you?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02312:
	ZH 1:
	'Is he hiding somewhere to try'
	R
	'and scare me again...?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_022da:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Mm... Here.'
	R
	'I was using the bathroom.'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Suzume, towel.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02358:
	!VAR0516 : 37!
	\L_0234a:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Your Majesty.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022be:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance held out his hands and'
	R
	'Suzume politely wiped his'
	R
	'hands with a towel.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Excuse me...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02358:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_0234a:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'So, what is it?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'This is unconfirmed'
	R
	'information, but...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Then don’t tell it to me.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, then I...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Wait a second.'
	R
	'Actually I’m interested, tell'
	R
	'me.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	R
	'It’s about Kite, the demon'
	R
	'that’s attacking Zeth...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah, that muscle head?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'There’s rumors that he visits'
	R
	'Green Village every day.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Green Village...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s a village between Zeth and'
	R
	'the Kalar Forest where victims'
	R
	'of greening disease are'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'quarantined.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmm, and a demon goes there...'
	R
	'I wonder if there’s something'
	R
	'to that...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m sure there is.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022a2:
	ZH 1:
	'Sounds like it’s worth'
	R
	'investigating.'
	\L_023ab:
