	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　　Zeth'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　　Green Village'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite stepped back into the'
	R
	'village that was abandoned by'
	R
	'humans.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	!VAR0516 : 57!
	\L_0234a:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu... Uuuu... Ah... Hick...'
	R
	'Hii...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s wrong, Calory...?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu...'
	R
	'Kite...!!'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022be:
	ZH 1:
	'When Calory heard Kite, she'
	R
	'ran over and bumped into him.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Lyla... Lylaaa!'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'The sickest girl that couldn’t'
	R
	'sleep... What happened?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu... Aaaah...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'...Did she pass away...?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_0232e:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory sobbed uncontrollably'
	R
	'while she nodded.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Did she pass on peacefully?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_0232e:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory shook her head.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'Then...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Suicide...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'What...?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'She committed suicide...'
	R
	'Just a moment ago...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'She said she remembered when'
	R
	'she caught greening disease...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'How her own parents looked at'
	R
	'her like she was vermin...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Her boyfriend treated her like'
	R
	'filth and thrust her away...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'She remembered that and cried'
	R
	'and screamed like she was'
	R
	'crazy...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Then she went to a cliff'
	R
	'and...!!'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_02286:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022f6:
	ZH 1:
	'Uu... Uuu... And I told her if'
	R
	'she stayed... Eventually'
	R
	'something good would happen...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Why...?'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_0232e:
	ZH 1:
	'Calory continued crying into'
	R
	'Kite’s chest.'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022a2:
	ZH 1:
	'Damn you, humans... These'
	R
	'children... My sister...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'They didn’t catch this disease'
	R
	'because they wanted to...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'How can you look at these'
	R
	'frail girls like that...?'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Unforgivable...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'They think only they matter,'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'and they express their contempt'
	R
	'for others openly as long as'
	R
	'they’re unaffected...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'They torment those weaker than'
	R
	'themselves and believe the sense'
	R
	'of superiority they get from'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'that is right...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'They’re the ones that should go'
	R
	'insane... They’re the ones that'
	R
	'should die...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll teach them that.'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... I was thinking about'
	R
	'this before Mr. Kayblis gave'
	R
	'me any orders...'
	\L_023ab:
	ZH 1:
	'Damn humans... I’ll teach you'
	R
	'how it feels to be despised...'
	R
	'Until it hurts...'
	\L_023ab:
	\L_0239e:
	\L_022be:
	ZH 1:
	'Kite hugged Calory’s small'
	R
	'body while she shivered'
	R
	'against his chest.'
